    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "The e+1 parameter-coefficient vectors of the degree-e primitive minimal Hankel kernel are linearly independent and pair to zero under both coefficient forms M_0 and M_1. They span a maximal common totally isotropic plane, meeting ker M_0 only in the exceptional locator line and ker M_1 only in the leading-coefficient line. This packages the full quadratic Hankel coefficient ledger.",
